# Intentionally empty. Passing this file to dev.aether.remap.RemapTool puts it in report mode: nothing
# is renamed, and every Minecraft member the compiled classes call in its development form is listed.
# That list is the work a real SRG mapping file has to cover, which is what makes the report a
# verification step rather than a decoration: the count is the number of call sites that would throw
# NoSuchMethodError on a production runtime, and it reaches zero only when the remap actually ran.
